DESCRIPTION:Salsa takes over the rooftop at Rise Over Run at Timbri hotel 
 on Thursday\, October 8.\n\nIn honor of Hispanic Heritage Month\, Rise Ove
 r Run brings Latin Nights to the rooftop with live DJs spinning salsa and 
 Latin favorites!\n\nSalsa takes over the rooftop at Rise Over Run at Timbr
 i hotel on Thursday\, October 8. The evening kicks off with a beginner-fri
 endly salsa & reparto class with @delvissavigne from 6 - 7 pm\, followed b
 y open dancing\, music by @djwaltdigz & @djleydis and cocktails overlookin
 g the San Francisco skyline.\n\nGuests can enjoy special food and drink of
 ferings\, with plenty of time to grab some bites and cocktails and hit the
  dance floor.\n\nNo prior dance experience needed!\n\n$10\n\nTickets: http
 s://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fsunset
 -salsa-tickets-2001032782920%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator%26keep_tld%3Dtrue\nDeta
 ils: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/8/sunset-salsa-tickets\nSource: D
 oTheBay
