DESCRIPTION:The 25th volume of the Italo Disco series featuring a family a
 ffair lineup!\n\nNow That's What I Call Italo-Disco is a local Bay-Area pa
 rty created by DJ PlayStation out of his love for Italo-Disco\; a playful 
 side of the 80's Although short lived\, Italo-Disco played a vital role in
  shaping electronic music and the club scene we all enjoy today. At this p
 arty we try to showcase the multifaceted genre in all its forms\, from cla
 ssic to contemporary\, we got you covered!\n\nincl. the Hits of:\nMo'ski\n
 Infinite Jess\nMeikee Magnetic\nDJ Playstation\n\nParis75\n515 Broadway\, 
 San Francisco\n\nno cover\, 21+\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J
